{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810880/extras/4f6aa9050c2d2c4b750587374d78e49a.avif?t=1759485869\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an era where the New Cold War loomed over the world, a time where the tiniest spark would have been all it took to tip the balance and start something ugly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was then that the giant cube suddenly appeared in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What followed was quick and deadly. Global superpowers mistook it as an escalation, and soon, civilizations crumbled under nuclear warheads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several decades passed. When the last survivors finally mustered up the courage to resurface, the cube that was still hovering in the sky swallowed them whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cube proved to be a two-edged sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who survived it came back with everything they needed to keep on surviving, while most never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As it is, you are left with two options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you face the cubes, or will you simply perish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Versatile Worlds of Cubes&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cube in THE CUBE, SAVE US is made up of 27 versatile pieces or fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you pass a cube gate, the surroundings and mutants get shifted to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be it downtown, a pyramid, an amusement park... You will need to find weapons and escape routes to protect you in unpredictable circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Fight and Survive&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you enter the cube, you will find yourself being targeted by vicious mutants and fellow raiders, the latter group doing what they do to survive\u2014much like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you know about close combat to fight and to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize skills, especially in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember. Too much sparing of skills and supplies can get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Raiders' Lair: New Cinderfall&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'New <strong>Cinderfall</strong>' a settlement founded by raiders who escaped the injustices of rangers, people with stories cheer on as raiders head toward the cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with them to learn how to better survive, to unveil the secrets hidden across the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is the cube here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the Cube appear in this world? And what does the Cube truly desire?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810880?t=1759485869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810880?t=1759485869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810880/01b4e34cd24f94ae32baaf0cd9a675c0fe304beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759485869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810880/01b4e34cd24f94ae32baaf0cd9a675c0fe304beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759485869","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"