d weapons and escape routes to protect you in unpredictable circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Fight and Survive&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you enter the cube, you will find yourself being targeted by vicious mutants and fellow raiders, the latter group doing what they do to survive\u2014much like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you know about close combat to fight and to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize skills, especially in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember. Too much sparing of skills and supplies can get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Raiders' Lair: New Cinderfall&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'New <strong>Cinderfall</strong>' a settlement founded by raiders who escaped the injustices of rangers, people with stories cheer on as raiders head toward the cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with them to learn how to better survive, to unveil the secrets hidden across the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is the cube here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the Cube appear in this world? And what does the Cube truly desire?</p>","developers":["XLGAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810880/52f5a8e234c8d8ebdc3a5248e3fed7c38aa1559c/header.jpg?t=1759485869","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>